          "name": "Absorb Force",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Frequency once per round\nTrigger A Force Barrage is fired at Usilket, and they are aware of it and have a free hand\nEffect Usilket \"catches\" the missile, absorbing it and causing that hand to glow while it holds this energy. A hand that's holding energy can only be used for Force Bolt. The energy lasts for 6 rounds or until it is released.",
