          "id": "kLTQKvpW6gblOUpU",
          "name": "Defender of Svaryr",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "The soldier's melee Strikes with a longsword become infused with the convictions of their duty, and deal an additional 2d6 mental damage against foes they fight while in Svarýr (Already included).",
