          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per minute\nEffect The Twin tasks its other half to aid themselves in combat. Until the start of their next turn, the Twins work together, providing flanking for themselves against all enemies within their reach. Flanking with themselves in this way is the same as flanking with an ally and so is subject to effects like all-around vision or the deny advantage class feature.",
