          "id": "sKsC8fD4GZJL7oNp",
          "name": "Reclaimed Fate",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Raven has eerie control over her immediate future. She can ignore any fortune or misfortune effects that affect her. If she is forced to roll twice as part of a fortune and misfortune effect, she can take whichever die result she prefers, even if the effect would normally force her to choose one of the results. Finally, when rolling initiative, Raven can choose not to roll initiative and instead have a result of 16 + her initiative modifier.",
