          "name": "Occult Catharsis",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Krohan's magic converts his pain into spellpower. After he casts an innate occult spell, he attempts a check (flat, dc:5), increasing the DC by twice the spell's rank if it was not a cantrip. On a success, Krohan's Spirits Drawn to Suffering effect ends; he can reduce the value of one condition affecting him by 1, and he regains 2d6 healing Hit Points.",
