          "name": "Spirits Drawn to Suffering",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Frequency once per 10 minutes\nTrigger Krohan critically fails a saving throw, takes mental damage, takes damage from a critical hit, or gains a harmful condition with a numerical value (such as frightened or sickened). This effect does not trigger due to self-harm or similarly engineered circumstances.\nEffect Krohan gains the ability to cast his innate occult spells for 1 minute.",
