          "name": "Rage",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements The monster hunter isn't Fatigued or raging\nEffect The monster hunter gains 9 temporary Hit Points that last until the rage ends. While raging, they deal 8 additional damage with melee attacks, gain a +10-foot status bonus to their Speed, and take a -1 penalty to AC. The monster hunter can't use concentrate actions except Seek and rage actions.\nThe rage lasts for 1 minute, until there are no enemies the monster hunter can perceive, or until the monster hunter falls unconscious.\nOnce the rage ends, the monster hunter can't again for 1 minute.\nEffect: Rage",
