          "id": "oncBOpovIROpa0vf",
          "name": "Explosion",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "When the elemental inferno dies, it explodes, dealing 7d6 fire damage to each creature in a 10-foot emanation (check (reflex, dc:30, basic, options:area-effect) save).",
