          "name": "Exhale Smoke",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A non-goblin creature approaches within 10 feet of the taxidermy Sandpoint Devil\nEffect The taxidermy Sandpoint Devil lurches forward, opens its jaws, and emits a blood-curdling howl and a blast of foul-smelling gray smoke. All creatures in a 30-foot cone directed south of the trap (which reaches all the way to the door leading out to the Pit) must attempt a check (fortitude, dc:22, options:area-effect,inflicts:enfeebled) save or become Enfeebled 1 for 1 hour (or Enfeebled 2 for 8 hours on a critical failure).",
