          "kind": "action",
          "description": "1 to 3\nFrequency once per round.\nEffect The angry townsfolk engage in a coordinated melee attack against each enemy within 10-foot emanation, with a check (reflex, dc:19, basic, options:area-effect) save. The damage depends on the number of actions.\n1 1d10 untyped damage\n2 1d10+7 untyped damage\n3 1d10+10 untyped damage",
