          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The grioth makes a Strike with a voidglass weapon.\nIf the Strike hits, it deals an additional 4d6 mental damage, and the target must succeed at a check (will, dc:26, traits:incapacitation) save (this has the incapacitation trait) or become Confused for 1 round.",
