          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The ghost cries out in pain and anguish as small objects and debris fly about in a 30-foot emanation. Creatures in this area take 6d6 bludgeoning damage, subject to a check (reflex, dc:29, basic, options:area-effect) save.",
