          "description": "Requirements A jinkin has a creature Grabbed with their pincer claw\nEffect The jinkin forcefully pulls the pincer claw out of the creature, ripping flesh and cackling in sadistic glee. The creature takes 1d8 piercing damage and is no longer grabbed.",
