          "name": "Falling Slab",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature attempts to move the slab;\nEffect The slab rips free from its track and falls, slamming down in one direction while it kicks up twisted metal debris in the other. All creatures adjacent to the slab take 3d6 bludgeoning and 3d6 piercing damage (check (reflex, dc:20, basic)).",
