          "description": "Trigger A creature enters or interacts with a space occupied by an id ooze\nRequirements Initiative hasn't yet been rolled\nEffect The id ooze automatically notices the creature, then makes a pseudopod Strike against one creature adjacent to itself before rolling initiative.",
