          "description": "An esobok ghoul's Strikes deal 1d6 void damage to living creatures. A creature critically hit by an esobok ghoul's Strike must attempt a check (fortitude, dc:18) save or become Drained 1 (Drained 2 on a critical failure) as rot spreads throughout their flesh.",
