          "description": "Trigger The worm prophet rolls a failure (but not a critical failure) on a Will save against an effect with the mental or fear trait\nRequirements The worm prophet's features are obscured by a mask or hood\nEffect The worm prophet takes 3d8 mental damage, and the saving throw is a success.",
