          "description": "The wolf unleashes a stream of bright green acid from its mouth, coating all creatures in a 30-foot line. All creatures in the line take 3d6 acid damage (check (reflex, dc:16, basic, options:area-effect) save).\nThe caustic wolf cannot use this ability again for 1 minute.",
