      "entryType": "HAZARD",
      "name": "Stalker Summoning Rune",
      "level": 7,
      "rarity": "uncommon",
      "size": "medium",
      "traits": [
        "magical",
        "trap"
      ],
      "description": "The sand conceals a rune that summons an invisible stalker into this yard.",
      "armorClass": 0,
      "hitPoints": 10,
      "hardness": 0,
      "stealth": {
        "modifier": 15,
        "details": "(expert)"
      },
      "disable": "check (acrobatics, dc:25, name:Approach Rune) to approach without triggering the trap followed by check (arcana, dc:25, name:Erase Rune) (expert) or check (thievery, dc:27, name:Erase Rune, traits:action:disable-a-device) (expert) to erase the rune, or Dispel Magic (4th rank; counteract DC 25) to counteract the rune",
