          "description": "Paga gains a +2 circumstance bonus when using the Seek action to find Hidden or Undetected creatures within 30 feet of her.\nWhen she targets an opponent that is Concealed from her or hidden, she reduces the DC of the flat check to check (flat, dc:3) for a concealed target or check (flat, dc:9) for a hidden one.",
