          "name": "Natural Camouflage",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Ssalarn's white and blue scales provide natural camouflage. In areas of snow and ice, Ssalarn can move at his full Speed when Sneaking, and he gains a +4 circumstance bonus to Hide.",
