          "description": "Requirements Volodmyra is wielding her greataxe and is adjacent to an enemy\nEffect Volodmyra raises her greataxe above her head and puts all of her might into a single attack. If the attack hits, Volodmyra deals an additional 8 points of damage and the opponent must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:17, options:inflicts:prone) save to avoid being knocked Prone.",
