          "id": "J4SHx8p5wCH9xlMo",
          "name": "Clench Jaws",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements Old Crackjaw damaged a creature with a jaws Strike in its previous action\nEffect Old Crackjaw clenches its jaws down and automatically deals an additional 2d8 bludgeoning damage to the creature it just bit.",
