          "description": "Requirements The kobold warrior is adjacent to at least one enemy.\nEffect The kobold warrior Strides up to its Speed plus 5 feet and gains a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against reactions triggered by this movement. It must end this movement in a space that's not adjacent to any enemy.",
