          "description": "Trigger A creature moves through the undergrowth\nEffect One round later, the hall fills with violet fog that imposes a -2 circumstance penalty to Perception checks to all creatures within it and exposes anyone who enters it to phantasmagoric fog.\nEffect: Phantasmagoric Fog",
