          "description": "Saving Throw check (fortitude, dc:26)\nMaximum Duration 6 rounds\nStage 1 5d6 poison damage (1 round)\nStage 2 6d6 poison damage (1 round)\nStage 3 8d6 poison damage (1 round)",
