          "name": "Enhanced Familiar",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Imeckus Stroon's familiar Lintwerth is a loyal companion and is a bit more powerful than the standard familiar in that he does not possess the minion trait; Imeckus can direct Lintwerth's actions verbally as a free action. If Lintwerth is slain, Imeckus becomes Drained 1 for 24 hours.",
