          "description": "The frost giant breathes out a 15-foot cone of freezing moisture that quickly condenses into ice, dealing 7d6 cold damage. Each creature in the cone must attempt a check (reflex, dc:36, basic, options:area-effect) save.\nA creature that fails its save is also Immobilized and takes 2d6 cold damage at the end of each of its turns until it gets free (Escape DC 36).\nThe giant can't use Chill Breath again for 1d4.",
