      "disable": "check (thievery, dc:14, name:Erase the Rune, traits:action:disable-a-device,magical,trap) (trained) to carefully erase the rune without triggering the sensors, Dispel Magic or a spell with the Light trait (1st level; counteract DC 15) to counteract the rune",
