          "description": "When an alchemical golem takes physical damage from a critical hit or is affected by a Shatter spell, one glass chamber within its body shatters, spewing alchemical liquid in a 5-foot emanation.\nRoll on the altered alchemical chambers list to determine which one shatters, and any creatures hit are affected as listed (check (reflex, dc:24)).\n1d6 |\nAlchemical Effect |\n1-2 |\ncheck (fortitude, dc:19) or Enfeebled 1 (Enfeebled 2 on a critical failure) |\n3-4 |\ncheck (fortitude, dc:19) or Sickened 1 (Sickened 2 on a critical failure) |\n5-6 |\ncheck (fortitude, dc:19) or Slowed for 1 round (slowed for 2 rounds on a critical failure) |",
