          "name": "Shroud",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements The shadow wisp's previous action was a hit against an adjacent creature with its shadow tendril Strike.\nEffect The shadow wisp Steps into the creature's space and attempts an check (acrobatics, defense:reflex) check against the target's Reflex DC to attach itself to the target's shadow.\nAs long as it remains attached, it moves with the target and is Off-Guard to attacks from the target. The target can spend a move action on its turn to attempt a Reflex save against the wisp's Acrobatics DC to escape the shroud.",
