          "name": "Exhale Miasma",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Ahksiva exhales a miasma of green vapors. Each living creature in a 15-foot cone is affected by her enfeebling humors (attempting a save as normal). She can't use Exhale Miasma again for 1d4.",
