          "description": "An abyssal fungus can unleash a cloud of spores that irritates the eyes and throats of non-fungus creatures in a 15-foot emanation. Each creature must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:12, options:area-effect,damaging-effect) save or take 1d4 persistent poison damage. A creature has its vision reduced as long as the persistent damage continues and can see only within 20 feet (10 feet on a critical failure).",
