          "description": "Trigger A creature tries to pick up or move the potion\nEffect The bottle shatters into pieces that fill a 5-foot burst. The burst deals 1 piercing damage (check (reflex, dc:19, basic) save). A creature who takes any damage is exposed to fermented potion.",
