          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "10 feet. The fire-eye zombie emits an aura of heat that causes open wounds to sizzle.\nAny living creature that starts its turn within 10 feet of the zombie and isn't at full HP must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:19, traits:damaging-effect) save or take 1d6 fire damage as its wounds burn.\nCreatures critically hit by the fire-eye zombie's Strikes must attempt this saving throw immediately.",
