          "description": "Trigger A creature attempts a melee attack against a zombie grindylow with a bludgeoning or slashing weapon\nEffect The creature must succeed at a check (reflex, dc:15) saving throw or become tangled in the kelp that surrounds the zombie grindylow, giving the creature a -10 circumstance penalty to its Speeds until it spends a manipulate action to remove the kelp.",
