          "id": "MPOQCX5VmgDx3OR4",
          "name": "Gunpowder Mastery",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "With their rifles' firing ability ruined beyond repair, the soldiers put their gunpowder reserves to use, making explosive arrows and rigging their guns to let off sparks on each successful bayonet Strike. On a critical hit with the bayonet, the target catches fire, taking 1d8 persistent fire damage (check (reflex, dc:21, traits:damaging-effect) negates).",
