      "disable": "check (athletics, dc:23, name:Hold Back Statue, traits:complex,hazard,magical,trap) to hold it back, check (crafting, dc:20, name:Break Statue, traits:complex,hazard,magical,trap) (trained) to break the statue by exploiting a flaw, check (occultism, dc:18, name:Dispel Planar Energies, traits:complex,hazard,magical,trap) (trained) to dispel the planar energies.",
