          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "When the corrupted wildfire successfully strikes a creature with an attack that deals persistent fire damage, the target becomes Sickened 1 (Sickened 2 on a critical hit). This condition cannot be reduced below 1 while the creature is subject to the persistent fire damage from the attack, and ends automatically when the persistent fire ends.",
