          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "A good creature bitten by a yeth hound must attempt a check (will, dc:25) save. On a critical success, the creature is temporarily immune to sinister bite for 1 minute. A creature that fails becomes Frightened 1, or increases the value of its frightened condition by 1 if already frightened.",
