          "description": "Trigger A creature makes a successful melee attack against the spirit or makes a successful Acrobatics check to Tumble Through the spirit's space\nEffect The spirit emits a brief pulse of void energy that deals 5d6 void damage to the triggering creature (check (reflex, dc:26, basic) save).",
