          "name": "Drain Life",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "When the demoniac spirit damages a living creature with its spectral claw Strike, the spirit gains 10 temporary Hit Points and the target must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:28, options:inflicts:drained) save or become Drained 1. Further damage dealt by the spirit increases the drained condition value by 1 on a failed save, to a maximum of drained 4.\nEffect: Drain Life",
