          "description": "While a mutated peryton's antler rifle is drawn, it is Off-Guard against melee Strikes. It can suppress the mutation to stow the antler rifle with a single Interact action; if it does so, it cannot use the weapon again until it re-activates the mutation and draws the weapon with another Interact action.",
