          "name": "Barrage of Spears",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature walks upon the mosaic.\nEffect The trap shoots a fusillade of shadow-wreathed spears out of the walls, making a Strike against each creature in area A1. Creatures who take damage from the spears must succeed at a check (will, dc:28) save or become Doomed 1 as the spears tear off part of their shadow.",
