          "name": "Unfinished",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Vrisk's smooth head does not have ears, so he's Deaf. He automatically critically fails any Perception checks that require hearing and is immune to auditory effects. He can supply verbal components for casting spells and command components for activating magic items, but if he performs an action he isn't accustomed to that involves auditory elements, he must succeed at a check (flat, dc:5) or the action is lost. He has both the Sign Language and Read Lips skill feats.",
