          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Requirements The dero stalker is not Encumbered.\nTrigger A creature targets the dero with an attack and the dero can see the attacker.\nEffect The dero dodges out of the way, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack.",
          "traits": []
