          "description": "Frequency once per day\nTrigger Liaskra is hit with an unarmed Strike or a Strike with a non-reach melee weapon\nEffect Liaskra breaks off quills in her attacker's flesh. She deals 1d8 piercing damage to the triggering creature (check (reflex, dc:17, basic)). On a critical failure, the creature also takes 1d4 persistent bleed damage as the quills hook into their flesh.",
