          "name": "Heart Break",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements Narcela has used Hold the Heart and is holding her bloodstone\nEffect Narcela shatters the bloodstone, sending shards into her enemies' chests. Until the end of her next turn, each enemy within 60 feet of Narcela takes a -1 item penalty to Will saves. The benefits of Hold the Heart immediately end. Narcela can't use Hold the Heart again for 1d6, as her heart needs time to regenerate.\nEffect: Heart Break",
