          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The scrit rubs its fingers against one page of writing, smearing the text and rendering it unreadable. The scrit can smear and destroy magical writing such as a Rune Trap or a Sigil by succeeding at a counteract check (using the scrit's 1d20+8) against the caster's DC.",
