      "routine": "(2 actions) On each of the trap's actions, the trap either moves a willing creature on the ground up to 30 feet without provoking reactions or makes a hostile creature on the ground Off-Guard for 1 round on a failed check (acrobatics, dc:20) check or check (reflex, dc:20) save.",
