          "name": "Feign Death",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The prowler wight quenches the telltale red glow in their eye sockets, falls Prone, and lies completely still. Until the next time they act, the prowler wight appears to be an ordinary corpse. They have an automatic result of 38 on Deception checks and DCs to pass as an ordinary corpse.",
