          "id": "v1cjchmhqo6lvdjy",
          "name": "Coordinated Strike",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "The wight commander flanks with an ally as long as the target is within both their reaches, even if commander and ally aren't on opposite sides.",
          "traits": []
