          "name": "Caustic Drool",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Caustic saliva drips from the warhound's mouth. Until the end of its turn, the abyssal warhound's jaws Strike deals an additional 2 points of acid damage on a successful attack, or 4 points on a critical success.\nEffect: Caustic Drool",
