          "description": "The pack leader throws its head back and lets out a bone-chilling howl. All abyssal warhounds and pack leaders with 30 feet that hear the call immediately activate their Caustic Drool ability as a free action. A creature that benefits from this effect becomes immune to this creature's call for one minute.",
