          "name": "Shake",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements The abyssal warhound's Caustic Drool ability is active\nEffect The warhound shakes its head, splattering nearby creatures with caustic saliva. All creatures within 10 feet of the warhound take 3d4 acid damage (check (reflex, dc:19, basic)). Abyssal warhounds are immune to this damage.",
