          "name": "Rage",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements The recon scout isn't Fatigued or raging\nEffects The recon scout gains 9 temporary Hit Points that last until the rage ends. While raging, they deal 8 additional damage with melee attacks, gain a +10-foot status bonus to their Speed, and take a –1 penalty to AC. The recon scout can't use concentrate actions except Seek and rage actions. The rage lasts for 1 minute, until there are no enemies the recon scout can perceive, or until the recon scout falls Unconscious. Once the rage ends, the recon scout can't Rage again for 1 minute.\nEffect: Rage",
