          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The wood scamp breathes choking pollen in a 15-foot cone that deals 2d6 poison damage to each creature within the area (check (reflex, dc:17, basic, options:area-effect); creatures who don't need to breathe are immune). The wood scamp can't use Breathe Pollen again for 1d4.",
