          "name": "Thorn Puncture",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "The wood scamp breaks off one of its thornlike claws in the target's skin, dealing 1 persistent bleed damage until the thorn is removed, which requires an Interact action. This damage is cumulative with each thorn caught in a creature's skin.",
