          "name": "Fume",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The brimorak emits a cloud of thick black smoke in a 10-foot burst that remains in place for 1d4.\nAll creatures within the smoke become Concealed, and all creatures outside the smoke become concealed to creatures within it. A creature that enters or begins its turn within the smoke it must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:23) save or become Sickened 1 (Sickened 2 on a critical failure).",
