      "isComplex": true,
      "routine": "(1 action) The swarm moves up to 30 feet to share the nearest creature's space, slicing into them with their paper wings and spurs. The targeted creature must attempt a check (reflex, dc:21) save.\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess The creature takes 2d8+5 slashing damage.\nFailure The creature takes 2d8 slashing damage and 1d6 persistent bleed damage.\nCritical Failure As failure, and the creature is Clumsy 1.",
