      "disable": "check (thievery, dc:21) (expert) to disable the sphere from rotating or Dispel Magic (3nd rank; counteract DC 23) to remove the enchantment.",
      "isComplex": true,
      "routine": "(1 action) A jeweled planet shoots from the sphere, targeting a random creature within 30 feet. The creature takes 2d8+7 bludgeoning damage (check (reflex, dc:22, basic) save).",
      "reset": "The trap deactivates and resets if 1 minute passes without any creature moving within range of its sensor.",
