          "id": "Siyz6bGUDIjuB2Rl",
          "name": "Husk Shield",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Frequency once per day\nTrigger The locust knight takes more than 10 damage in one blow\nEffect The locust knight molts, leaving their discarded exoskeleton behind and Striding up to their full speed. The molted exoskeleton has an AC of 20, 15 Hit Points, and is treated as an enemy occupying that space for purposes of flanking.\nHusk Shield",
