          "name": "Elemental Burst",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per round\nEffect Asper releases the elemental aura she currently holds, dealing 2d8 electricity damage (if air), 2d8 fire damage, or 2d8 cold damage (if water) damage. She cannot use elemental aura again for that element for 2 rounds.",
