          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature looks at the carved mourner\nEffect The hallways fill with a thick mist. When the mist first appears, all living creatures in area A take 1d6 void damage (check (fortitude, dc:17, basic) save), and all undead creatures regain 1d6 healing Hit Points. All creatures within the mist become Concealed. This mist lasts for 1 hour or until the haunt is disabled.",
