          "name": "Dominance Display",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per hour\nEffect The arabuk postures and roars. All non-arabuk creatures within 30-foot emanation must attempt a check (will, dc:23, options:area-effect,damaging-effect) save.\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected and is temporarily immune to this arabuk's Dominance Display for 24 hours.\nSuccess The creature takes 2d12 sonic damage.\nFailure The creature takes 2d12+13 sonic damage and is Frightened 1.\nCritical Failure The creature takes 2d12+13 sonic damage and is Frightened 2.",
