      "disable": "check (thievery, dc:30) (expert) or check (arcana, dc:28), check (nature, dc:28), check (occultism, dc:28), or check (religion, dc:28) (expert) to seal each of the four time rifts, check (crafting, dc:30) (trained) to divert the lightning to another source, or Dispel Magic (4th rank; counteract DC 26) to counteract each time rift.",
      "isComplex": true,
      "routine": "(4 actions) The trap loses 1 action each turn for each disabled time rift. On each of the trap's actions, the Eternity Arch releases a bolt of lightning that activates that rift, dealing 2d12 electricity damage to all creatures in a 10-foot emanation around the time rift (check (reflex, dc:28, basic) save). It can release a bolt at each active time rift no more than once each turn.",
