          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Nyctessa can use the Craft activity to create alchemical and magical items. In addition to her known spells, her spellbook contains the formulas for Bottled Night, Antiplague (Lesser), Comprehension Elixir (Lesser), Steelscour (Moderate), Oil of Unlife (Lesser), Unholy Water, and Void Salts.",
